    "content": "<div class=\"ncp-feed-preview\" data-ncp-feed-preview aria-label=\"패스트캠퍼스 쿠폰 요약\">\n  <div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>입력 코드</span><strong>RAG비법노트</strong></div>\n  <div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>강의 할인</span><strong>20%</strong></div>\n  <div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>안내 기한</span><strong>12월 31일</strong></div>\n</div>\n<!--more-->\n<article data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\" class=\"ncp-coupon-article\">\n<style>\n.ncp-feed-preview{display:none!important}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"]{--ink:#1f2937;--muted:#667085;--line:#dfe5ed;--soft:#f7f9fc;--blue:#2457d6;--green:#067647;color:var(--ink);font-size:16px;line-height:1.72}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] *{box-sizing:border-box}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] h1{font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,36px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 12px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] h2{font-size:23px;line-height:1.32;margin:34px 0 14px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 8px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] p{margin:0 0 13px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] .ncp-hero{padding:0 0 22px;margin:0 0 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] .ncp-lead{font-size:17px;color:#344054}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] .ncp-meta{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] .ncp-badge{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:100px;padding:4px 10px;background:var(--soft);font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] .ncp-coupon-card{border:1px solid #ced6e4;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;margin:0 0 14px;overflow:hidden}\n[data-ncp-article=\"fastcampus-rag-code-202610\"] .ncp-coupon-top{display:flex;justify-conten